<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAfrica's Dynamo Securities admitted as JSE member.</title>
<headline>SAfrica's Dynamo Securities admitted as JSE member.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Dynamo Securities (Pty) Ltd has been admitted as a corporate entity (limited liability) member of the Johannesburg Stock Exchange, the JSE said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
